---
// src/pages/privacy-policy.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | GradeCalculatorFinalX"
  description="Read the GradeCalculatorFinalX Privacy Policy. Learn about our commitment to client-side computing, zero data harvesting, and student privacy protection."
>
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 880px; padding-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 5rem;">
    <!-- Breadcrumb & Return to Calculator -->
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem;">
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--color-mute);">
        <a href="/" style="color: var(--color-mute); text-decoration: none;">Home</a>
        <span style="margin: 0 0.5rem; color: var(--color-hairline);">&gt;</span>
        <span style="color: var(--color-ink); font-weight: 500;">Privacy Policy</span>
      </nav>
      <a href="/" class="btn btn-secondary" style="font-size: 0.8125rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <line x1="19" y1="12" x2="5" y2="12"></line>
          <polyline points="12 19 5 12 12 5"></polyline>
        </svg>
        <span>Back to Calculator</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Page Header -->
    <header style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-hairline); padding-bottom: 1.75rem;">
      <span class="mono-eyebrow" style="color: var(--color-blue); margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">Transparency & Security</span>
      <h1 class="heading-lg" style="color: var(--color-ink); font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.25rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-top: 0.25rem;">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--color-mute); margin-top: 0.5rem;">
        Last Updated: September 2, 2026 &bull; Effective Immediately
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content Card -->
    <article class="geist-card" style="padding: 2.25rem 2rem; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--color-body);">
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2.25rem;">
        <div>
          <h2 class="heading-md" style="color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 1.25rem;">
            1. Introduction & Core Privacy Commitment
          </h2>
          <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
            Welcome to <strong>GradeCalculatorFinalX</strong> ("we", "our", or "us"), accessible via <strong>gradecalculatorfinalx.com</strong>. We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting any information you share with us.
          </p>
          <p>
            Unlike many educational platforms that require mandatory logins, tracking cookies, or cloud database storage, GradeCalculatorFinalX is engineered as a <strong>privacy-first, client-side application</strong>. We believe your academic grades, GPA histories, and course names belong exclusively to you.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="heading-md" style="color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 1.25rem;">
            2. Information We Do NOT Collect
          </h2>
          <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
            When using our grade calculator tools, we do not collect, store, or transmit:
          </p>
          <ul style="padding-left: 1.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem;">
            <li>Your personal grades, exam scores, or category weight percentages.</li>
            <li>Your course titles, instructor names, or institutional affiliations.</li>
            <li>Your student identification numbers or educational records.</li>
            <li>Any mandatory registration credentials, passwords, or phone numbers.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="heading-md" style="color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 1.25rem;">
            3. LocalStorage & Client-Side Data Storage
          </h2>
          <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
            To enable autosaving so that your assignment rows, course profiles, and grading scales remain intact between visits, our website uses your browser's native <strong>LocalStorage</strong> technology.
          </p>
          <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
            All LocalStorage entries (such as <code>gradecalc_courses_v1</code> and <code>gradecalc_scale_v1</code>) remain strictly inside your device's browser sandbox. This data is never sent to our servers or accessible by third parties. You can clear this data at any time by clicking the "Clear All" buttons inside the tool or by clearing your browser cache.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="heading-md" style="color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 1.25rem;">
            4. Encrypted URL Sharing
          </h2>
          <p>
            When you choose to use the "Share" feature to share your course structure with classmates or advisors, the tool encodes your current course parameters into a URL hash fragment (<code>#data=...</code>). Because URL hash fragments are processed exclusively by client-side JavaScript, the shared course data is never transmitted across web servers during page requests.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="heading-md" style="color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 1.25rem;">
            5. Cookies, Analytics, and Third-Party Services
          </h2>
          <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
            We do not use tracking cookies for targeted commercial advertising. Standard non-identifying server logs (such as browser type, operating system, and timestamp) may be recorded by our hosting infrastructure to diagnose server errors, mitigate cyber threats, and optimize content delivery performance.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="heading-md" style="color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 1.25rem;">
            6. Children's Online Privacy Protection (COPPA)
          </h2>
          <p>
            Our website is designed for general audiences, including high school and college students. We do not knowingly solicit or collect personal information from children under the age of 13. Since no personal information is collected or stored on our servers, our service complies fully with the provisions of COPPA.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="heading-md" style="color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 1.25rem;">
            7. Contact for Privacy Inquiries
          </h2>
          <p>
            If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact our team via our <a href="/contact" style="color: var(--color-blue); text-decoration: underline;">Contact Us</a> page or email us at <strong>privacy@gradecalculatorfinalx.com</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Bottom Return Action -->
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 3rem;">
      <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; text-decoration: none; padding: 0.65rem 1.25rem;">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <line x1="19" y1="12" x2="5" y2="12"></line>
          <polyline points="12 19 5 12 12 5"></polyline>
        </svg>
        <span>Return to Grade Calculator</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
